There is a bug in the save game feature on v3.0j:  if your name gets changed
during the game, the file is saved under that name, not your login, and when
you try to start up again, it will not recognize the save file as yours.  I
think that a better way to restore a save file would be to look at only the
user number, not the name.  BTW, this is on Unix SVR3.

